  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHw/262",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">원격수업이 이어지니,<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아이들도 수업을 안듣기 위한 여러 고도화 전략을 -_-;;; 펼치고<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">갖은 방법도 능동적인 학습을 만들기는....온라인이라 한계가 있더라구요. ㅠㅅㅠ</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그래서 요즘은, <span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>더빙 수업을</b> </span>합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvej88opxjes7y28tqfqu765e@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvej88opxjes7y28tqfqu765e%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33164047129%26signature%3DHa6a79zIKTBvaL3TKtMMkgK9TgU%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvej88opxjes7y28tqfqu765e?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2ZWo4OG9weGplczd5Mjh0cWZxdTc2NWUiLCJ0aWQiOiI2Y2ViYjE5OS1lYjVhLTQxMTYtOTZkNi1kZDkxZmY2M2E2YjciLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODY3MzV9.WNGJhyRKdnnIRKWKRly7zxqZRL9AtyWOteNTlWPr5VRqvZ78B3Hf8OmdXglc6MjYA50A3hsPw7xlVXmWlFGZXA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. zoom 으로 <span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>소리없는 동영상을</b> </span>함께 보며, <span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>더빙하는 연습을 같이</b> </span>합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;선창! 복창! 구간 반복으로요.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 아이들은 <span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><b>음성녹음한 파일을 [패들렛]에</b> </span>올립니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래는 평범한 학생의 예시입니다.<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">(아이들 녹음파일을 듣고, 잘못 표현한 부분은 피드백...;;; 하면 시간이 엄청 걸리긴합니다 ㅎㅎ 이친구도 끝 부분을 놓친..)</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0e6mh1df5tmhmc8xwbkobua@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frv6xlbiajcx8xcjg4hcvwuwgw%2Fthumbs%2F1.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33164047212%26signature%3DRftLCdcc80v0oYn7e%252Fzeyy0WN0g%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0e6mh1df5tmhmc8xwbkobua?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MGU2bWgxZGY1dG1obWM4eHdia29idWEiLCJ0aWQiOiIzY2NhYjc3Yy04ODE2LTRjY2YtYWUxZS1jMTQzYmI4NzkzYmQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODY3MzV9.0m8QstOrJZw23etbJhSCJ_WOE12argyKS0122ENStO1f0erFAsJSj_Cxir-mGtQCTbl_HWkdz-iLbq9DerJ_iw&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">더빙수업은 어느 단원에도 학습정리를 능동적으로 시키기 좋은 것 같아요.<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">단원 정리시에 스스로 말을 하며 과정을 복기하는게</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">특히 [동물과 에너지] 단원에 맞춤형인듯 했습니다.<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">유투브에 3d 영상을 편하여 소순호배 맞춤으로 1분 2분 내로 만드니 좋았어요.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">짧은 영상 편집한 것으로, 무한 반복 연습하며 익히고...<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">과제가 있으니 연습할 때도 zoom 수업에 적극적으로 참여합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">패들렛에 음성녹음하는 기능이 있어 바로 올릴 수 있어 좋은데,<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">폰하나로만 수업듣는 아이들은 녹음과 영상플레이가 동시에 안되어,<br><br><br>폰의 녹음 어플을 쓰고 파일을 보내라하니 생각보다 잘 하더라구요.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b96708dee65c7bad1235b90f7ee72912b2216d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8b96708dee65c7bad1235b90f7ee72912b2216d9\" data-origin-width=\"1214\" data-origin-height=\"764\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>패들렛에 공유하기로 pdf 를 만들어 보관하니, <br><br>처음엔 음성파일을 패들렛에 삭제해도 pdf에서 플레이가 되길래 쾌재를 외쳤는데.... 다시하니&#160;안되더라구요. ㅠㅠ;;;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55ef6a408994da108fcea64cdd53c626f1c03daa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55ef6a408994da108fcea64cdd53c626f1c03daa\" data-origin-width=\"1587\" data-origin-height=\"734\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>그럼에도 불구하고, 안하는 아이는....안하긴 합니다만;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1학년은 빛을 배우고, 랩....시키듯이 빠른 더빙을 시켰더니<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">나름 랩하는 재미로 도전을 하더라구요. ^-^;;<br><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">(아래 2개 영상을 동시에 플레이하시면 맞춤으로 보입니다. 아이가 멈추며 녹음을 해서 싱크가 맞진 않습니다.)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv4lnmy1d12b1frksvbrfo6r7@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frv4lnmy1d12b1frksvbrfo6r7%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33164047379%26signature%3DXv5YeiO%252B7hUauYOnRlfJntmO3rQ%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv4lnmy1d12b1frksvbrfo6r7?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NGxubXkxZDEyYjFmcmtzdmJyZm82cjciLCJ0aWQiOiIwOGQwZmMyOS03M2YxLTQ4MmUtYWFkNi1iOGVkMzg4MmJmYzUiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODY3MzV9.ZhUSBABZBNde17CV1iyq57U7USVhFWDVXnYbpq9pD3B_Vn2m11OnXFatJO93nnqzdxK7OaCTFCSQ_yLENij2ZA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvu916akudnkzih9b5p88954z@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frv6xlbiajcx8xcjg4hcvwuwgw%2Fthumbs%2F1.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33164047618%26signature%3DtUz9AfMDna4zmFFDP1GcMV3D8wA%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvu916akudnkzih9b5p88954z?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2dTkxNmFrdWRua3ppaDliNXA4ODk1NHoiLCJ0aWQiOiJlZDE3NTZkMy1lNzM0LTQ3OWUtYjEwNy1lNWYwM2NlMTIwMDYiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODY3MzV9.zdG9VxNCAVJuC_IfE350jrhdP-jbudcZ4hlyePHdl81RDx4EfXu62RRwzBR30Xk99CVBSquYpz436seDLN0OLg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;<br>짧은 영상만 있으면,<br><br>선생님들도 큰 부담없이 수업진행이 가능할 것 같습니다. <br><br>녹음파일도 점프점프하며 들으면 체크가 충분히 되구요. <br><br>헌데 녹음파일을 들으면 50명에 1명 정도는 사기를 치더라구요. ^^;;, (교과서를 그냥 읽음)<br><br>영~ 못하는 애들은 친구꺼 듣고 따라하라고 하니 얼추 비슷하게는 하더라구요. <br><br>벌써 학기말이네요. <br><br>코로나로 참 어렵지만, <br>따뜻한 연말되시기 바랍니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
